[{"text":"KiraCreateIntegralFile[ex, topo, path] extracts GLI symbols from ex that belong to the topology topo. The resulting list of integrals is saved to path/topoName/KiraLoopIntegrals.txt and can be referred to in the corresponding Kira job file.","anchor":"kiracreateintegralfile"},{"text":"Notice that ex may also contain integrals from different topologies, as long as all those topologies are provided as a list in the topo argument.","anchor":"kiracreateintegralfile"},{"text":"It is also possible to invoke the routine as KiraCreateIntegralFile[ex, {topo1, topo2, ...}, {path1, path2, ...}] or KiraCreateIntegralFile[ex, {topo1, topo2, ...}, {path1, path2, ...}] if one needs to process a list of topologies.","anchor":"kiracreateintegralfile"},{"text":"The syntax KiraCreateIntegralFile[ex, {topo1, topo2, ...}, path] or KiraCreateIntegralFile[ex, {topo1, topo2, ...}, path] is also allowed. This implies that all config files will go into the corresponding subdirectories of path, e.g. path/topoName1, path/topoName2 etc.","anchor":"kiracreateintegralfile"},{"text":"The default name of the file containing loop integrals for the reduction is \"KiraLoopIntegrals.txt\". It can be changed via the option KiraIntegrals.","anchor":"kiracreateintegralfile"},{"text":"Overview, KiraCreateConfigFile, KiraIntegrals.","anchor":"see-also","section":"See also"},{"text":"ints = la^8*GLI[\"asyR3prop2Ltopo01310X11111N1\", {-7, 1, 1, 9, 1}] + la^8*GLI[\"asyR3prop2Ltopo01310X11111N1\", {-6, 0, 2, 8, 1}] - la^7*GLI[\"asyR3prop2Ltopo01310X11111N1\", {-6, 1, 1, 8, 1}] - la^8*mg^2*GLI[\"asyR3prop2Ltopo01310X11111N1\", {-6, 1, 2, 8, 1}] + la^8*GLI[\"asyR3prop2Ltopo01310X11111N1\", {-5, -1, 3, 7, 1}] - la^7*GLI[\"asyR3prop2Ltopo01310X11111N1\", {-5, 0, 2, 7, 1}] - 2*la^8*mg^2*GLI[\"asyR3prop2Ltopo01310X11111N1\", {-5, 0, 3, 7, 1}] + la^6*GLI[\"asyR3prop2Ltopo01310X11111N1\", {-5, 1, 1, 7, 1}] + la^7*mg^2*GLI[\"asyR3prop2Ltopo01310X11111N1\", {-5, 1, 2, 7, 1}] + la^8*mg^4*GLI[\"asyR3prop2Ltopo01310X11111N1\", {-5, 1, 3, 7, 1}];","anchor":"cb1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"topo = FCTopology[\"asyR3prop2Ltopo01310X11111N1\", {SFAD[{{I*p1, 0}, {0, -1}, 1}], SFAD[{{I*p3, 0}, {-mg^2, -1}, 1}], SFAD[{{0, -2*p3 . q}, {0, -1}, 1}], SFAD[{{0, -2*p1 . q}, {0, -1}, 1}], SFAD[{{I*(p1 - p3), 0}, {0, -1}, 1}]}, {p1, p3}, {q}, {Hold[SPD][q, q] -> mb^2}, {}]","anchor":"cb2","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\text{FCTopology}\\left(\\text{asyR3prop2Ltopo01310X11111N1},\\left\\{\\frac{1}{(-\\text{p1}^2-i \\eta )},\\frac{1}{(-\\text{p3}^2+\\text{mg}^2-i \\eta )},\\frac{1}{(-2 (\\text{p3}\\cdot q)-i \\eta )},\\frac{1}{(-2 (\\text{p1}\\cdot q)-i \\eta )},\\frac{1}{(-(\\text{p1}-\\text{p3})^2-i \\eta )}\\right\\},\\{\\text{p1},\\text{p3}\\},\\{q\\},\\left\\{\\text{Hold}[\\text{SPD}][q,q]\\to \\;\\text{mb}^2\\right\\},\\{\\}\\right)","anchor":"cb2-4","section":"Examples"},{"text":"fileName = KiraCreateIntegralFile[ints, topo, FileNameJoin[{$FeynCalcDirectory, \"Database\"}]]; fileName // FilePrint","anchor":"cb3","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\text{KiraCreateIntegralFile: Number of loop integrals: }10\\]","anchor":"cb3-2","section":"Examples"},{"text":"(*{asyR3prop2Ltopo01310X11111N1[-7, 1, 1, 9, 1], asyR3prop2Ltopo01310X11111N1[-6, 0, 2, 8, 1], asyR3prop2Ltopo01310X11111N1[-6, 1, 1, 8, 1], asyR3prop2Ltopo01310X11111N1[-6, 1, 2, 8, 1], asyR3prop2Ltopo01310X11111N1[-5, -1, 3, 7, 1], asyR3prop2Ltopo01310X11111N1[-5, 0, 2, 7, 1], asyR3prop2Ltopo01310X11111N1[-5, 0, 3, 7, 1], asyR3prop2Ltopo01310X11111N1[-5, 1, 1, 7, 1], asyR3prop2Ltopo01310X11111N1[-5, 1, 2, 7, 1], asyR3prop2Ltopo01310X11111N1[-5, 1, 3, 7, 1]}*)","anchor":"cb4","section":"Examples"},{"text":"fileName = FIRECreateIntegralFile[ints, topo, 1500, FileNameJoin[{$FeynCalcDirectory, \"Database\"}]]; fileName // FilePrint","anchor":"cb5","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\text{FIRECreateIntegralFile: Number of loop integrals: }10\\]","anchor":"cb5-2","section":"Examples"},{"text":"(*{{1500, {-7, 1, 1, 9, 1}}, {1500, {-6, 0, 2, 8, 1}}, {1500, {-6, 1, 1, 8, 1}}, {1500, {-6, 1, 2, 8, 1}}, {1500, {-5, -1, 3, 7, 1}}, {1500, {-5, 0, 2, 7, 1}}, {1500, {-5, 0, 3, 7, 1}}, {1500, {-5, 1, 1, 7, 1}}, {1500, {-5, 1, 2, 7, 1}}, {1500, {-5, 1, 3, 7, 1}}}*)","anchor":"cb6","section":"Examples"},{"text":"FIRECreateIntegralFile[ints, topo, 1500, FileNameJoin[{$FeynCalcDirectory, \"Database\"}], FCVerbose -> -1];","anchor":"cb7","section":"Examples"},{"text":"ex2 = c1 GLI[prop1l, {1, 1}] + c2 GLI[prop1l, {2, 0}] + c3 GLI[tad2l, {1, 1, 0}] + c4 GLI[tad2l, {1, 1, 1}] l","anchor":"cb8","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\text{c1} G^{\\text{prop1l}}(1,1)+\\text{c2} G^{\\text{prop1l}}(2,0)+\\text{c3} G^{\\text{tad2l}}(1,1,0)+\\text{c4} l G^{\\text{tad2l}}(1,1,1)\\]","anchor":"cb8-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"topos = { FCTopology[prop1l, {FAD[{p1, m1}], FAD[{p1 + q, m2}]}, {p1}, {q}, {}, {}], FCTopology[tad2l, {FAD[{p1, m1}], FAD[{p2, m2}], FAD[{p1 - p2, m3}]}, {p1, p2}, {}, {}, {}] }","anchor":"cb9","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\left\\{\\text{FCTopology}\\left(\\text{prop1l},\\left\\{\\frac{1}{\\text{p1}^2-\\text{m1}^2},\\frac{1}{(\\text{p1}+q)^2-\\text{m2}^2}\\right\\},\\{\\text{p1}\\},\\{q\\},\\{\\},\\{\\}\\right),\\text{FCTopology}\\left(\\text{tad2l},\\left\\{\\frac{1}{\\text{p1}^2-\\text{m1}^2},\\frac{1}{\\text{p2}^2-\\text{m2}^2},\\frac{1}{(\\text{p1}-\\text{p2})^2-\\text{m3}^2}\\right\\},\\{\\text{p1},\\text{p2}\\},\\{\\},\\{\\},\\{\\}\\right)\\right\\}","anchor":"cb9-5","section":"Examples"},{"text":"fileNames = KiraCreateIntegralFile[ex2, topos, FileNameJoin[{$FeynCalcDirectory, \"Database\"}]];","anchor":"cb10","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\text{KiraCreateIntegralFile: Number of loop integrals: }2\\]","anchor":"cb10-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\text{KiraCreateIntegralFile: Number of loop integrals: }2\\]","anchor":"cb10-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"fileNames[[1]] // FilePrint (*{prop1l[1, 1], prop1l[2, 0]}*)","anchor":"cb11","section":"Examples"},{"text":"fileNames[[2]] // FilePrint (*{tad2l[1, 1, 0], tad2l[1, 1, 1]}*)","anchor":"cb12","section":"Examples"},{"text":"KiraCreateIntegralFile[ex2, topos, FileNameJoin[{$FeynCalcDirectory, \"Database\"}], FCVerbose -> -1, KiraIntegrals -> \"LIs.m\"]","anchor":"cb13","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\{\\text{/home/vs/.Mathematica/Applications/FeynCalc/Database/prop1l/LIs.m},\\text{/home/vs/.Mathematica/Applications/FeynCalc/Database/tad2l/LIs.m}\\}","anchor":"cb13-2","section":"Examples"}]